---
title: News & Updates
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /blog/
wide: true
eyebrow: News
hero_heading: News and updates
hero_accent: updates
hero_subtext: Progress toward the house, program milestones, and ways to get involved.
hero_image: /assets/images/photos/road-day.webp
hero_w: 1536
hero_h: 1024
hero_alt: A quiet tree-lined residential street in bright morning daylight.
hero_pos: 50% 60%
meta_description: News and updates from Oasis Women Center in Denton County, Texas.
---

<section class="bd bd-paper">
  <div class="bd-in">
    {% if collections.posts | length %}
    <div class="posts">
      {%- for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="post" data-rv>
        <p class="post-date">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="sec-center" data-rv>
      <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
      <h2 class="title">Nothing posted <em>just yet</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Updates will land here as we move toward opening the first home. Until then, the fastest way to follow along is to reach out directly.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
